cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RL Spin Decoupler"
type: software
version: 1.2.1
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/uncore-team/rl_spin_decoupler"
url: "https://uncore-team.github.io/rl_spin_decoupler/"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that synchronizes a reinforcement-learning loop with an agent loop
  that runs in another process and may follow a different clock, and reports the
  duration of each action and the time of each observation.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - robotics
  - sockets
  - Gymnasium
